1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,284
The outside pressure came as a session of the faculty board, where a clear definition was demanded of the term consent.

2
00:00:07,284 --> 00:00:13,632
“Your outline must include the literal spelling of every field,” the director said.

3
00:00:13,632 --> 00:00:24,300
“A copy of the form is not a transaction.” The four of them had to speak to a room that held all the power and none of the facts.

4
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:30,439
The gap between the border of the law and the boundary of decency was the real subject.

5
00:00:30,439 --> 00:00:42,922
A baseball game on the radio, a graph on the wall, and a symbol of the university above the entrance: the interval between them was the space where the project lived.

6
00:00:42,922 --> 00:00:49,791
Health data was not included in the review, and that was exactly the point.

7
00:00:49,791 --> 00:00:53,455
My reluctance was not about compliance.

8
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:59,274
“We must undertake a renovation of the whole process,” Maya said.

9
00:00:59,274 --> 00:01:17,150
“We cannot fetch consent with a modification of the wording.” A thief of small permissions, a scatter of skipped steps, and a detection system that nobody trusted: this was penetration by habit, not by attack.

10
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:20,195
The view from the lab was different.

11
00:01:20,195 --> 00:01:33,297
“Put the standardization in place, normalize the browser logs, and the coherence will follow,” the engineer said, with a confidence that the data did not support.

12
00:01:33,297 --> 00:01:43,336
The empty shelf, the late submission, and the walk to the door were, to him, a subtraction of detail.

13
00:01:43,336 --> 00:01:53,114
The gravitation of the argument pulled them toward conformity: rank the fields, divide the risks, and file the rest.

14
00:01:53,114 --> 00:01:57,198
“Not off, not on,” Lin wrote.

15
00:01:57,198 --> 00:02:08,561
“The system must hold a parallel record of what we refused to collect.” The talk in the corridor was that the board would stop the project anyway.

16
00:02:08,561 --> 00:02:20,429
Its action, in the end, was small: a summary of four pages, a perspective on the person, and a statement of what the project would not do.

17
00:02:20,429 --> 00:02:26,533
“If you cannot understand it, you cannot consent to it,” she said.

18
00:02:26,533 --> 00:02:31,692
The game was not over, and the walk back to the lab was long.

19
00:02:31,692 --> 00:02:42,058
The significance of the start was that they had to resume the work with fewer people, and the four of them could not agree on where to begin.
